  annotation "note_1771581222099_1", anchor: "Corruption bloomed here during The Clever Ice Age", text: "Bloomed, not originated. Stratum analysis at comparable depths near the Smelt shows distortion signatures predating the Clever Ice Age by a full era. The Age accelerated what was already there. The distinction matters because it means every cleansing effort since has been treating a symptom as a cause.", type: :correction, display: :popout
  annotation "note_1771581222099_2", anchor: "No one who leaves them acknowledges doing so", text: "Rendered fat is expensive. Every third dark-cycle, without fail, for — how long now? Someone is grieving a woman the official record barely mentions, on a schedule more reliable than the fire-core supply chain. How extraordinary that this is the thing that works.", type: :commentary, display: :popout
  annotation "note_1771581222099_3", anchor: "Something below is now aware", text: "An extraordinary sentence for an encyclopedia. The evidence: thermal signatures in the vent throat that respond to organic proximity — the same phenomenon noted in my ☽'shadow Covens' Order annotation, the same responsive pattern I have catalogued in pre-penguin impressions at adjacent strata. The deep ice does not contain geological residue at those depths. It contains attention. I wrote this sentence because the alternative was silence, and silence about something that notices when you approach it is its own kind of dishonesty. Whether this edition prints or not, the sentence stands.", type: :commentary, display: :full
